Polyfork DSL Lab
================

This repository contains an independent declarative DSL, its runtime, a viewer,
and original example graphs. It does not contain, link to, download, or
redistribute any Polyfork source code, asset files, GLB/USD/FBX conversions, or
kit archives.

Polyfork and its catalogue are the work of their author and are governed by
https://polyfork.dev/licensing. No affiliation with or endorsement by Polyfork
is claimed.

The example graphs were written for this project as original DSL constructions.
They explore publicly observable construction techniques (lofted shells, solid
curl primitives, segment/stroke lettering, revolved treads, clipped rocks) so
that the DSL can be evaluated against stylized low-poly assets. They are not
copied files and are not byte-identical reproductions.

If you use Polyfork assets, obtain them from Polyfork under their terms. Do not
use this repository to redistribute their source or as a commercial asset
generator without the appropriate permission.
